# Vibe coded by Codex
Subject: [PATCH] Add -x ASCII text output to stdout

Apply from the ansilove source root with patch -p1.
Based on Ansilove 4.2.2. Build and install the accompanying libansilove patch first.
Usage: ansilove -x input.ans > output.txt
Includes documentation and regression tests.

